#: ../../source/sql/sql_vector_function.md:133 6f2b0cd8851143128f11aefb737c9818
msgid ""
"Measures the L2 distance between 2 points. That is, the length of the line "
"between the points represented by the vectors; the shorter the distance, the "
"more similar the source objects are conceptually."
msgstr ""
"测量两点之间的 L2 距离。也就是说，矢量所代表的点之间的直线长度；距离越短，说"
"明源对象在概念上越相似。"

#: ../../source/sql/sql_vector_function.md:163 dd63a4a2c21d41a6be60907411e7e164
msgid "6. cosDistance(vector_colume, array[1,2,3…])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/sql/sql_vector_function.md:165 13530a6edfb7458698bbf8ed366f8b17
msgid ""
"Measures the cosine of the angle between two vectors, i.e., the dot product "
"divided by the length."
msgstr "测量两个向量间夹角的余弦值，即点积除以长度。"
